> Caches play a critical role in network and computer systems for reducing request latency and source traffic. Various cache eviction algorithms have been developed to elevate cache hits. Heuristics-based schemes are lightweight but inflexible, asynchronous-learning-based schemes require high resources support and infer slowly, and synchronous-learning-based schemes sacrifice performance for in-time inference.
