+
+\textbf{Percentile robustness.}
+Fig.~\ref{fig:robust-percentile} reports percentile curves over grouped traces.
+RSD keeps favorable tails rather than only improving median cases, indicating better worst-case control under heterogeneous workloads.
+This matches the design goal of decoupling: model updates can absorb long-term drift, while online decisions remain lightweight and stable.
+
