+
+\textbf{Dual-metric robustness.}
+Fig.~\ref{fig:robust-dual} summarizes normalized average performance from both absolute and relative perspectives.
+RSD maintains a strong joint position instead of trading one metric for another, confirming balanced robustness over OMR/BMR objectives.
+
